  - SCN-010 is implemented for separating explicit force-rebuild failure from successful clustering dependency installation.
  - SCN-011 is implemented for translating permission-denied virtual environment preparation failures into actionable Vela errors.
  - SCN-012 is implemented for failing clearly when `networkx` verification fails after dependency installation.
